FT8 and FT4 message filters

Full stop) Select the next filter.
Comma) Select the previous filter.

All shows every decoded message. Calling CQ includes directed CQs.
Distance uses the grid in the message. The default is 2000 km.

e) Edit the distance cutoff. Press k for kilometres or m for miles. Press q at the unit question to cancel. Enter a positive number and press Enter to save and select the distance filter. A blank entry aborts and keeps the previous filter. You return to the filter selector.

q) Return to the results and keep the selected filter for this YAC session.

